 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;　　另一方面，在京都的尊氏其权力正稳步扩张，而在镰仓，以尊氏之弟——直义为首的新统治也正大受欢迎。 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;　　在时代更迭的巨大浪潮中，时行夺回天下的这场捉迷藏，其结局将会走向何方——。<\/p>","vod_plot":0,"vod_plot_name":"","vod_plot_detail":"","type":{"type_id":25,"type_name":"日韩动漫","type_en":"rihandongman","type_sort":2,"type_mid":1,"type_pid":4,"type_status":1,"type_tpl":"type.html","type_tpl_list":"show.html","type_tpl_detail":"detail.html","type_tpl_play":"","type_tpl_down":"","type_key":"","type_des":"","type_title":"","type_union":"","type_extend":{"class":"","area":"","lang":"","year":"","star":"","director":"","state":"","version":""},"type_logo":"","type_pic":"","type_jumpurl":"","type_1":{"type_id":4,"type_name":"动漫","type_en":"donman","type_sort":4,"type_mid":1,"type_pid":0,"type_status":1,"type_tpl":"type.html","type_tpl_list":"show.html","type_tpl_detail":"detail.html","type_tpl_play":"play.html","type_tpl_down":"down.html","type_key":"新番动漫,动漫大全,热门动漫,日本动漫,国内动漫,欧美动漫,好看的动漫,动画片大全,好看的动画片,动漫排行榜","type_des":"最新热门动漫大全，最新好看的日本动漫在线观看。","type_title":"新番动漫大全 - 热门日本动漫","type_union":"","type_extend":{"class":"动画,日韩动漫,喜剧,剧情,科幻,家庭,奇幻,冒险,欧美动漫,动作,悬疑,犯罪,爱情,惊悚,灾难,音乐,恐怖,战争,运动,歌舞,古装,历史,短片,国产动漫,战斗","area":"大陆,日本,美国,韩国,西班牙,其它","lang":"日语,英语,国语,韩语,其它","year":"2026,2025,2024,2023,2022,2021,2020,2019,2018,2017,2016,2015,2014,2013,2012,2011","star":"","director":"","state":"","version":"TV版,电影版,OVA版,真人版"},"type_logo":"","type_pic":"","type_jumpurl":"","childids":"24,25,26,27"}},"type_1":{"type_id":4,"type_name":"动漫","type_en":"donman","type_sort":4,"type_mid":1,"type_pid":0,"type_status":1,"type_tpl":"type.html","type_tpl_list":"show.html","type_tpl_detail":"detail.html","type_tpl_play":"play.html","type_tpl_down":"down.html","type_key":"新番动漫,动漫大全,热门动漫,日本动漫,国内动漫,欧美动漫,好看的动